[{"id":168375269,"discussion_id":"fb671ecf2e79624afdda60496cedf353044e573e","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*tang-hao-hw-gitcode*](https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode), [*zzy__*](https://gitcode.com/zzy__) (2/2) | ✅ [*tang-hao-hw-gitcode*](https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n qq_45930774, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-15T11:48:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-16T16:36:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168375386,"discussion_id":"dcd26881273a6f2efc11cede000e211e26336e51","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了Flash Attention算子中两个与注意力掩码处理相关的关键缺陷。第一个缺陷是在特定GS布局下，注意力掩码数据复制过程中，因张量偏移计算错误可能导致数据被写入错误的内存位置，引发计算错误或程序崩溃。第二个缺陷是在GQA非量化推理等特定场景下，掩码信息结构体中的一个字段被错误地赋值为编译期常量，而非实际运行时数据量，导致掩码处理范围计算不准确，影响注意力计算的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n针对第一个问题，修改了`AttentionmaskCopyInForGsLayout`函数，将计算张量偏移时使用的错误变量`attenMaskSizeAlign`替换为正确的`attenMaskS2Stride`，确保了跨行数据复制时目标地址的准确性。针对第二个问题，在`FANoQuantBlockVecBase::ProcessVec1Nd`函数中，将赋值给`maskInfo.s2dealNum`的常量`s2BaseSize`修正为动态变量`runInfo.s2RealSize`，使掩码处理逻辑能够匹配每次循环实际处理的数据量。两项修改均属于内部逻辑修正，旨在提升算子在不同场景下的功能正确性和稳定性。","created_at":"2026-04-15T11:48:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-15T11:48:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168516123,"discussion_id":"f51491bba85ebdab16dfcf2811e7c978a9531079","body":"/check-pr","created_at":"2026-04-16T14:59:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-16T14:59:00+08:00","user":{"id":"68c2315759d71b2d89a80e41","login":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","object_id":"68c2315759d71b2d89a80e41","name":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168516136,"discussion_id":"4aa9d884139956da99991908f814dfe660177592","body":"**The following labels are not ready**.\n\nlgtm: Please wait for reviewers to review the code.\n\napproved: Please wait for committers to review the code.\n\nci-pipeline-passed: Please wait for the CI test to be completed.\n\n","created_at":"2026-04-16T14:59:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-16T14:59:03+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168516150,"discussion_id":"06aa3baf0d07120b5eddb7882b8cfc27dc5741c2","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-04-16T14:59: